<title>HONG KONG: Star Telecom shares trade suspended.</title>
<headline>Star Telecom shares trade suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of paging services operator Star Telecom International Holdings Ltd was suspended at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong Stock Exchange said on Tuesday.  </p>
<p>Shares of Star Telecom fell HK$0.125 or 4.17 percent to HK$2.875 on Monday on volume of 881,600 shares.</p>
<p>The company is due to release its interim results on Thursday.</p>
<p>Star Telecom said earlier this month it had agreed to set up a 30 percent-owned venture with a third party to invest in and operate radio paging services in Southeast Asia.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
